doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21518698"
url: "https://stefanosbalaskas.github.io/gp3bayes/"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  gp3bayes provides transparent, contract-first infrastructure for Bayesian
  analysis of repeated-measures and hierarchical behavioural data. It supports
  governed binary, positive-duration, dynamic-pupillometry, SCR-responsivity,
  and trial-level multilevel mediation workflows with explicit readiness and
  provenance contracts, inspectable priors, predictive checks, restricted
  optional full-MCMC fitting, diagnostics, posterior estimands, sensitivity
  analysis, predictive validation, and conservative reporting.
keywords:
  - Bayesian workflows
  - hierarchical models
  - repeated measures
  - behavioural data
  - posterior predictive checks
  - sensitivity analysis
  - predictive validation
